> Call [DescribeInstanceIds](https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/157459.html) to query the IDs of all Anti-DDoS Pro and Anti-DDoS Premium instances.

This parameter is required.', example='ddoscoo-cn-mp91j1ao****'),
  module?: string(name='Module', description='The module for Layer 7 port support. The default value is sla. Valid value:

**sla**: Speed Limit for Destination', example='sla'),
